		<mdElement elementClass='PropertyManager'>
			<name>USER_MODE_PROPERTIES</name>
			<propertyManagerID>_2021x_1_2cc0115_1618221246269_755494_323128</propertyManagerID>
			<mdElement elementClass='StringProperty'>
				<propertyID>DESCRIPTION</propertyID>
				<propertyDescriptionID>DESCRIPTION_DESCRIPTION</propertyDescriptionID>
				<value>Perspective provides features primarily dedicated for eliciting requirements and modeling the system. Analysis features are highlighted. Configuration is modeling oriented. Code engineering, transformations and other features are hidden.</value>
			</mdElement>
			<mdElement elementClass='StringProperty'>
				<propertyID>USER_MODE_DESCRIPTION</propertyID>
				<propertyDescriptionID>USER_MODE_DESCRIPTION_DESCRIPTION</propertyDescriptionID>
				<value>Analyst Standard mode will simplify MagicDraw interface, features usage and suggest most popular items. It is possible to change experience mode from each of functionality. User Mode customization to your needs is available from Main Menu / Options.</value>
			</mdElement>
